) VALUES (
    'history-of-alpine-skiing',
    '{"en": "History of Alpine Skiing: From Mountain Necessity to World Cup Glory", "de": "Geschichte des alpinen Skilaufs: Von der Bergnot zur Weltcup-Herrlichkeit", "fr": "Histoire du ski alpin : De la nécessité montagnarde à la gloire de la Coupe du monde", "it": "Storia dello sci alpino: Dalla necessità montana alla gloria della Coppa del Mondo", "es": "Historia del esquí alpino: De la necesidad montañesa a la gloria de la Copa del Mundo", "pt": "História do esqui alpino: Da necessidade montanhosa à glória da Copa do Mundo", "nl": "Geschiedenis van het alpine skiën: Van bergnoodzaak tot Wereldbeker glorie", "ar": "تاريخ التزلج الألبي: من ضرورة الجبال إلى مجد كأس العالم", "ja": "アルペンスキーの歴史：山の必需品からワールドカップの栄光へ", "zh": "Gaoshan Huaxue Lishi: Cong Shanqu Xuyao dao Shijie Bei Rongguang", "ko": "알파인 스키의 역사: 산악 필수품에서 월드컵 영광까지"}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "Alpine skiing evolved from a practical way to travel through snowy mountains into one of the most thrilling and prestigious winter sports. Discover the journey from wooden skis to carbon fiber racing machines.", "de": "Alpines Skifahren entwickelte sich von einer praktischen Art, durch verschneite Berge zu reisen, zu einer der aufregendsten Wintersportarten.", "fr": "Le ski alpin a évolué d''un moyen pratique de voyager dans les montagnes enneigées à l''un des sports d''hiver les plus passionnants.", "it": "Lo sci alpino si è evoluto da un modo pratico per viaggiare attraverso le montagne innevate a uno degli sport invernali più emozionanti.", "es": "El esquí alpino evolucionó de una forma práctica de viajar por montañas nevadas a uno de los deportes de invierno más emocionantes.", "pt": "O esqui alpino evoluiu de uma forma prática de viajar por montanhas nevadas para um dos esportes de inverno mais emocionantes.", "nl": "Alpine skiën evolueerde van een praktische manier om door besneeuwde bergen te reizen tot een van de meest opwindende wintersporten.", "ar": "تطور التزلج الألبي من وسيلة عملية للسفر عبر الجبال المغطاة بالثلوج إلى واحدة من أكثر الرياضات الشتوية إثارة", "ja": "アルペンスキーは、雪山を移動する実用的な方法から、最もスリリングなウィンタースポーツの一つへと発展しました。", "zh": "Gaoshan huaxue cong chuanyue xueshan de shiyong fangshi fazhan chengwei zui jidong renxin de dongji yundong zhiyi.", "ko": "알파인 스키는 눈 덮인 산을 여행하는 실용적인 방법에서 가장 스릴 넘치는 겨울 스포츠 중 하나로 발전했습니다."}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "<p>The story of <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">alpine skiing</a> begins thousands of years ago, when people in snowy regions first strapped wooden planks to their feet to travel across frozen landscapes. What started as survival became sport, and eventually, one of the most watched and celebrated winter activities in the world.</p><h2>Ancient Origins</h2><p>The earliest evidence of skiing dates back over 5,000 years to Scandinavia and Central Asia. Rock carvings in Norway show hunters on skis pursuing game. These early skis were tools for survival, allowing people to hunt, trade, and communicate across vast snowy distances.</p><p>The word \"ski\" comes from the Old Norse \"skíð,\" meaning a split piece of wood. For centuries, skiing remained primarily a practical transportation method in Nordic countries.</p><h2>Birth of Modern Alpine Skiing</h2><p>The transformation from transportation to sport began in the mid-1800s in the European Alps. Norwegian skiing techniques spread to Central Europe, where the steep mountain terrain demanded new methods.</p><p>In 1896, Austrian Mathias Zdarsky developed the first alpine-specific technique, adapting the long Nordic skis and creating binding systems that allowed for controlled turns on steep slopes. His \"Lilienfeld technique\" is considered the foundation of modern alpine skiing.</p><h2>The Racing Era Begins</h2><p>The first organized downhill race took place in 1911 at Montana, Switzerland. In 1924, the Fédération Internationale de Ski (FIS) was founded to govern ski racing. The sport gained massive popularity throughout the 1920s and 1930s.</p><p>Arnold Lunn, a British skiing pioneer, invented the modern slalom in 1922, creating a race format that tested precision and agility alongside speed.</p><h2>World Cup Revolution</h2><p>The FIS Alpine Ski World Cup launched in 1967, creating a season-long competition that would crown the best overall skier. Legendary venues like <a href=\"/kitzbuehel-venue-guide/\">Kitzbühel</a>, <a href=\"/wengen-venue-guide/\">Wengen</a>, and <a href=\"/val-gardena-venue-guide/\">Val Gardena</a> became temples of the sport.</p><p>The World Cup transformed skiing from a series of isolated events into a dramatic season-long narrative, with athletes like Jean-Claude Killy, Ingemar Stenmark, and later <a href=\"/marcel-hirscher-profile/\">Marcel Hirscher</a> becoming global sporting icons.</p><h2>Modern Era</h2><p>Today''s alpine skiing features five disciplines: downhill, super-G, giant slalom, slalom, and combined. Athletes reach speeds over 150 km/h on downhill courses, while slalom skiers make over 60 turns in under a minute.</p><p>Modern stars like <a href=\"/mikaela-shiffrin-profile/\">Mikaela Shiffrin</a>, <a href=\"/marco-odermatt-profile/\">Marco Odermatt</a>, and <a href=\"/sofia-goggia-profile/\">Sofia Goggia</a> continue pushing the boundaries of what''s possible on skis, building on five millennia of skiing heritage.</p><h2>Equipment Evolution</h2><p>From wooden planks to modern carbon fiber racing skis, equipment has transformed dramatically. Leather bindings gave way to release bindings that prevent injuries. Wooden poles became lightweight carbon fiber. Each innovation has allowed athletes to go faster, turn sharper, and push harder.</p><p>The sport that began as mountain survival now represents the pinnacle of athletic achievement on snow.</p>", "de": "<p>Die Geschichte des <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">alpinen Skifahrens</a> beginnt vor Tausenden von Jahren, als Menschen in schneereichen Regionen erstmals Holzbretter an ihre Füße schnallten. Was als Überleben begann, wurde zum Sport.</p><h2>Antike Ursprünge</h2><p>Die frühesten Beweise für Skifahren reichen über 5.000 Jahre nach Skandinavien zurück. Felsmalereien in Norwegen zeigen Jäger auf Skiern.</p><h2>Geburt des modernen alpinen Skifahrens</h2><p>Die Transformation vom Transport zum Sport begann Mitte des 19. Jahrhunderts in den europäischen Alpen.</p><h2>Weltcup-Revolution</h2><p>Der FIS Alpine Ski Weltcup startete 1967. Legendäre Austragungsorte wie <a href=\"/kitzbuehel-venue-guide/\">Kitzbühel</a> und <a href=\"/wengen-venue-guide/\">Wengen</a> wurden zu Tempeln des Sports.</p><h2>Moderne Ära</h2><p>Moderne Stars wie <a href=\"/mikaela-shiffrin-profile/\">Mikaela Shiffrin</a> und <a href=\"/marco-odermatt-profile/\">Marco Odermatt</a> setzen die Tradition fort.</p>", "fr": "<p>L''histoire du <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">ski alpin</a> commence il y a des milliers d''années, lorsque les habitants des régions enneigées ont attaché des planches de bois à leurs pieds pour la première fois.</p><h2>Origines anciennes</h2><p>Les premières preuves de ski remontent à plus de 5 000 ans en Scandinavie. Des gravures rupestres en Norvège montrent des chasseurs sur des skis.</p><h2>Révolution de la Coupe du monde</h2><p>La Coupe du monde FIS de ski alpin a été lancée en 1967. Des lieux légendaires comme <a href=\"/kitzbuehel-venue-guide/\">Kitzbühel</a> et <a href=\"/wengen-venue-guide/\">Wengen</a> sont devenus des temples du sport.</p><h2>Ère moderne</h2><p>Les stars modernes comme <a href=\"/mikaela-shiffrin-profile/\">Mikaela Shiffrin</a> et <a href=\"/marco-odermatt-profile/\">Marco Odermatt</a> continuent de repousser les limites.</p>", "it": "<p>La storia dello <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">sci alpino</a> inizia migliaia di anni fa, quando le persone nelle regioni innevate legarono per la prima volta tavole di legno ai piedi.</p><h2>Origini antiche</h2><p>Le prime prove di sci risalgono a oltre 5.000 anni fa in Scandinavia. Incisioni rupestri in Norvegia mostrano cacciatori sugli sci.</p><h2>Rivoluzione della Coppa del Mondo</h2><p>La Coppa del Mondo FIS di sci alpino è stata lanciata nel 1967. Luoghi leggendari come <a href=\"/kitzbuehel-venue-guide/\">Kitzbühel</a> e <a href=\"/wengen-venue-guide/\">Wengen</a> sono diventati templi dello sport.</p><h2>Era moderna</h2><p>Star moderne come <a href=\"/mikaela-shiffrin-profile/\">Mikaela Shiffrin</a> e <a href=\"/marco-odermatt-profile/\">Marco Odermatt</a> continuano a spingere i limiti.</p>", "es": "<p>La historia del <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">esquí alpino</a> comienza hace miles de años, cuando las personas en regiones nevadas ataron por primera vez tablas de madera a sus pies.</p><h2>Orígenes antiguos</h2><p>Las primeras evidencias de esquí datan de hace más de 5.000 años en Escandinavia.</p><h2>Revolución de la Copa del Mundo</h2><p>La Copa del Mundo FIS de Esquí Alpino se lanzó en 1967.</p>", "pt": "<p>A história do <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">esqui alpino</a> começa há milhares de anos, quando pessoas em regiões nevadas amarraram pranchas de madeira aos pés pela primeira vez.</p><h2>Origens antigas</h2><p>As primeiras evidências de esqui datam de mais de 5.000 anos na Escandinávia.</p><h2>Revolução da Copa do Mundo</h2><p>A Copa do Mundo FIS de Esqui Alpino foi lançada em 1967.</p>", "nl": "<p>Het verhaal van <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">alpine skiën</a> begint duizenden jaren geleden, toen mensen in besneeuwde regio''s voor het eerst houten planken aan hun voeten bevestigden.</p><h2>Oude oorsprong</h2><p>Het vroegste bewijs van skiën dateert van meer dan 5.000 jaar geleden in Scandinavië.</p><h2>Wereldbeker revolutie</h2><p>De FIS Alpine Ski Wereldbeker werd gelanceerd in 1967.</p>", "ar": "<p>تبدأ قصة <a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">التزلج الألبي</a> قبل آلاف السنين، عندما ربط الناس في المناطق الثلجية ألواحاً خشبية بأقدامهم لأول مرة.</p><h2>الأصول القديمة</h2><p>أقدم الأدلة على التزلج تعود إلى أكثر من 5000 عام في الدول الاسكندنافية.</p><h2>ثورة كأس العالم</h2><p>انطلقت كأس العالم للتزلج الألبي في عام 1967.</p>", "ja": "<p><a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">アルペンスキー</a>の物語は数千年前に始まります。雪の多い地域の人々が初めて木の板を足に結びつけた時からです。</p><h2>古代の起源</h2><p>スキーの最も古い証拠は、5,000年以上前のスカンジナビアに遡ります。</p><h2>ワールドカップ革命</h2><p>FISアルペンスキーワールドカップは1967年に始まりました。</p>", "zh": "<p><a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">Gaoshan huaxue</a> de gushi kaishi yu shiqian nian qian, dangnei xueyu diqu de renmen shouci ba muban bang zai jiao shang.</p><h2>Gudai qiyuan</h2><p>Huaxue de zuizao zhengju keyi zhuisu dao 5000 duo nian qian de Sigandinawiya.</p><h2>Shijie Bei geming</h2><p>FIS Gaoshan Huaxue Shijie Bei yu 1967 nian qidong.</p>", "ko": "<p><a href=\"/alpine-skiing-guide/\">알파인 스키</a>의 이야기는 수천 년 전, 눈이 많은 지역 사람들이 처음으로 나무 판자를 발에 묶었을 때 시작됩니다.</p><h2>고대 기원</h2><p>스키의 가장 오래된 증거는 5,000년 이상 전 스칸디나비아로 거슬러 올라갑니다.</p><h2>월드컵 혁명</h2><p>FIS 알파인 스키 월드컵은 1967년에 시작되었습니다.</p>"}'::jsonb,
    'historical',
    'AS',
    '{"en": "History of alpine skiing - From ancient wooden skis to modern World Cup racing, discover how skiing evolved from survival skill to premier winter sport.", "de": "Geschichte des alpinen Skifahrens - Von antiken Holzskiern zum modernen Weltcup-Rennen.", "fr": "Histoire du ski alpin - Des skis en bois anciens aux courses modernes de Coupe du monde.", "it": "Storia dello sci alpino - Dagli antichi sci di legno alle moderne gare di Coppa del Mondo.", "es": "Historia del esquí alpino - Desde los antiguos esquís de madera hasta las carreras modernas de la Copa del Mundo.", "pt": "História do esqui alpino - Dos antigos esquis de madeira às corridas modernas da Copa do Mundo.", "nl": "Geschiedenis van alpine skiën - Van oude houten ski''s tot moderne Wereldbeker races.", "ar": "تاريخ التزلج الألبي - من الزلاجات الخشبية القديمة إلى سباقات كأس العالم الحديثة", "ja": "アルペンスキーの歴史 - 古代の木製スキーから現代のワールドカップレースまで", "zh": "Gaoshan huaxue lishi - Cong gudai muxue dao xiandai Shijie Bei bisai", "ko": "알파인 스키의 역사 - 고대 나무 스키에서 현대 월드컵 레이싱까지"}'::jsonb,
